# Firebase Data Connect SDK Generation

When generating or refreshing Firebase Data Connect SDKs in this repository, prefer the project wrapper:

```bash
./firebase/scripts/generate_dataconnect_sdks.sh
```

Use this instead of calling `firebase dataconnect:sdk:generate` directly. The wrapper runs SDK generation and then applies the required Dart SDK post-processing for the generated nullable `BigInt` serializer.

If adding or changing Data Connect schema, connector operations, or generated SDK files, mention whether this wrapper was run.
